DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42842::$$$message_0353_0000_0000$$$::"Hm? Did I take a wrong turn?[lr]::
42843::$$$message_0353_0000_0001$$$::I seem to have wandered into the old Edelfelt den..."::
42844::$$$message_0353_0000_0002$$$::"Is this the mansion of those famous twin mages?[lr]::
42845::$$$message_0353_0000_0003$$$::I sense something ominous... As if your granddaughter spent some time here."::
42846::$$$message_0353_0000_0004$$$::"Hm. She was here. I can feel it in my bones."::
42847::$$$message_0353_0000_0005$$$::"Oh, well. This was an error. Let us go to the dragon cave, Assassin."::
42848::$$$message_0353_0000_0006$$$::"Once we deal with that nuisance of a knight, that is."[nolr]::
42849::$$$message_0353_0000_0007$$$::"So you've noticed me.[lr]::
42850::$$$message_0353_0000_0008$$$::You haven't lost your edge despite your age, Zolgen Makiri."::
42851::$$$message_0353_0000_0009$$$::"Now that's a name I've not heard in many years.[lr]::
42852::$$$message_0353_0000_0010$$$::That must make you one of the Red Branch..."::
42853::$$$message_0353_0000_0011$$$::"Hm? Mm? Hmmm?"::
42854::$$$message_0353_0000_0012$$$::"W-what?[lr]::
42855::$$$message_0353_0000_0013$$$::Why are you staring at my face?"::
42856::$$$message_0353_0000_0014$$$::"Hmm. You seem familiar... Where have I seen you... It was recent, I think..."::
42857::$$$message_0353_0001_0000$$$::"You there,[hfwww layer=1] young man. Give me a hint."::
42858::$$$message_0353_0001_0001$$$::"Man, what a drag... I'm gonna melt."::
42859::$$$message_0353_0001_0002$$$::"Oh, you talkin' to me, grandpa?[lr]::
42860::$$$message_0353_0001_0003$$$::Hm, isn't he...[lr]::
42861::$$$message_0353_0001_0004$$$::One of the regulars at the maid cafe near the station?"[seloop storage=se254.wav]::
42862::$$$message_0353_0001_0005$$$::"Yes, that's it! I remember, Assassin! [hfwww layer=1]That lady knight is the clumsy maid I mentioned before!"::
42863::$$$message_0353_0001_0006$$$::"What!? Ah, ahhh![lr]::
42864::$$$message_0353_0001_0007$$$::Now that you mention it, you're from that one time...!"::
42865::$$$message_0353_0001_0008$$$::"Oh? So you're saying she put on a maid outfit that didn't match her womanly character at all..."::
42866::$$$message_0353_0001_0009$$$::"Like a hostess at a club who instantly transforms an innocent, floral space into an erotic cosplay pub for old men."[nolr]::
42867::$$$message_0353_0002_0000$$$::[hfl][cm][hfu][cm]"N[hfl]"[hfu]n[hfl]N[hfu]n[hfl]ngh[hfu]ngh[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]![hfl]![hfu]"[hfl]"[lr]::
42868::$$$message_0353_0002_0001$$$::[hfu][br backlog=0](t[hfl](t[hfu]re[hfl]re[hfu]mb[hfl]mb[hfu]le[hfl]le[hfu]s[hfl]s [hfu] [hfl]vi[hfu]vi[hfl]ol[hfu]ol[hfl]en[hfu]en[hfl]tl[hfu]tl[hfl]y[hfu]y[hfl][hfu])[hfl])[nolr]::
42869::$$$message_0353_0002_0002$$$::"Ah, now that was a sight to behold![lr]::
42870::$$$message_0353_0002_0003$$$::You stood out, surrounded by all those lovely young things!"::
42871::$$$message_0353_0002_0004$$$::"Like Tokyo Tower, or Tsutenkaku![lr]::
42872::$$$message_0353_0002_0005$$$::Y'know, red all over!"::
42873::$$$message_0353_0002_0006$$$::"So...[lr]::
42874::$$$message_0353_0002_0007$$$::You were fired, if I'm not mistaken?"::
42875::$$$message_0353_0002_0008$$$::"Yeah. She came home crying after two days. Still, though, that's actually a pretty good run for my Master."::
42876::$$$message_0353_0002_0009$$$::"Don't bite your tongue, Avenger!"::
42877::$$$message_0353_0002_0010$$$::"Five tons[line len=2]hurgh!?"[rf][p][hfmsg2layer src=0 dest=2][nolr]::
42878::$$$message_0353_0002_0011$$$::"(That Master has it rough...)"::
42879::$$$message_0353_0002_0012$$$::"What's so funny!?"::
42880::$$$message_0353_0002_0013$$$::"I-I'm not laughing."::
42881::$$$message_0353_0002_0014$$$::"Owwww... [wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=アヴェンジャー face=喜 layer=0 time=300]Oh yeah, Master. That's just what his face looks like. [hfwww layer=0]You shouldn't make fun of people's looks."::
42882::$$$message_0353_0002_0015$$$::"...![lr]::
42883::$$$message_0353_0002_0016$$$::(I think we can be friends!)"::
42884::$$$message_0353_0002_0017$$$::"Th-they insulted us first! Let's go, Avenger!"::
42885::$$$message_0353_0003_0000$$$::"I'm going to beat the memory out of every single customer who saw me at that maid cafe!"::
42886::$$$message_0353_0003_0001$$$::"...Damn. She's attacking people for another crazy reason."�Pi